{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melon Bounce</strong> is a casual puzzle game where you drag and launch cute fruits at your desired angle and strength, merging matching fruits together.<br>Start with small cherries or blueberries and evolve into bigger fruits, with the ultimate goal of creating a sweet melon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will it really end with the melon\u2026? A next stage awaits, only for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple Controls, Deep Strategy</strong><br>Adjust the angle and power with a single drag to launch fruits. Easy for anyone to pick up, but precise control is needed to aim for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4a <strong>The Thrill of Merging</strong><br>When matching fruits collide, a new fruit is born! The step-by-step evolution keeps you coming back for more challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude06 <strong>Lively Fruit Characters</strong><br>With diverse expressions and animations, these fruits feel less like objects and more like cute, living companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Refreshing Beach Stage</strong><br>Enjoy charming visuals set against a seaside backdrop of sand and ocean waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Variety of Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Ice Mode</strong>: Sometimes fruits get frozen solid and won\u2019t move. Use your wits to adapt to these unpredictable moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Bomb Mode</strong>: Boom! A single explosion can turn the game around in an instant for thrilling tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Mini Mode</strong>: Fruits shrink to bite-size, demanding precise control to slip through narrow gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26aa <strong>White Berry Mode</strong>: Only white fruits can be launched! Craft unique strategies with this special restriction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Climb the rankings by scoring high! Prove your skills and feel the thrill of seeing your name among the top players.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lemon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/e00cf18c6d6186505ded187b6184d5ea98c76c56.jpg"},{"name":"Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/a7890015f5f02e56126f2f78123ded813d7f88b6.jpg"},{"name":"Pear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/5e7e828ae71ba44ce644892b0e7d95f840816150.jpg"},{"name":"Peach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/012e0ec239d638f04404c83d47ee73a873080fa3.jpg"},{"name":"Watermelon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/b3bdf9d80422cb37c9f21c0e93042f96246705bc.jpg"},{"name":"Melon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/1f198471b841263097d54a7a7c52af0fa69b3d40.jpg"},{"name":"Coconut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/6795d37bd3191aaee9e1c4e5af401c4bb442430c.jpg"},{"name":"Pineapple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/082d0f8b40aac828e076baaeeda3d880f28ace31.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon Fruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953080/9aa861e86ea30b213f133a8e5d8e75daa55acdff.jpg"},{"name":"